        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8475, Single Cylinder Neos Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Neos Single Cylinder Deadbolt looks straight off the trendiest architecture in Miami. It features the modern art deco style that drives the style of Miami. The Single Cylinder Neos Deadbolt is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Neos Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Neos Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
