                "description": "The Emtek Neos Single Cylinder Deadbolt looks straight off the trendiest architecture in Miami. It features the modern art deco style that drives the style of Miami. The Single Cylinder Neos Deadbolt is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.",
